# DO NOT PUT REAL PASSWORDS HERE.
# We no longer use a local .env file.
#
# To run the backend, ask the team for the Supabase PostgreSQL credentials.
# Paste them directly into your IDE (IntelliJ Run Configurations) as Environment Variables.
#
# Expected keys:
# SUPABASE_DB_USERNAME=your_supabase_user
# SUPABASE_DB_PASSWORD=your_supabase_password